        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4705, Urban Modern Entry Door Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEmtek's Tubular Urban Modern Handleset features a two piece design in which the deadbolt portion is separated from the grip and thumb-press for a classic look that works beautifully on transitional decor. The  Urban Modern Entry Door Handleset has some modern design elements, but it also leans heavily on the classic beauty of traditional styles, allowing this front door lock to look at home on your home's front door. This entrance set is actually available in either a dummy or a single cylinder function. It will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from several popular finishes and a huge selection of interior trim levers and knobs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Urban Modern Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Urban Modern Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1\" - 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4705-specifications.pdf?v=1704262403\"><b>Emtek 4705 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Urban Modern Two Piece Handleset",
                "description": "Emtek's Tubular Urban Modern Handleset features a two piece design in which the deadbolt portion is separated from the grip and thumb-press for a classic look that works beautifully on transitional decor. The  Urban Modern Entry Door Handleset has some modern design elements, but it also leans heavily on the classic beauty of traditional styles, allowing this front door lock to look at home on your home's front door. This entrance set is actually available in either a dummy or a single cylinder function. It will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from several popular finishes and a huge selection of interior trim levers and knobs.",
                "keywords": "Emtek Urban Modern Entrance Handlesets, Urban Modern Tubular Handlesets, Urban Modern Single Cylinder Entry Door Handlesets, Urban Modern Entry Door Handlesets, Urban Modern Two Piece Handlesets, Emtek 4705, Emtek 4715, modern handlesets, contemporary handlesets, front door handles, front door locks, entry door handlesets with deadbolts, front door handle replacements, modern front door handles"
            },
